+++
title: The question underneath the question
coach: jane
date: 2025-03-10
domains: change, discovery, intimate
+++

"What should I do?" is almost never the real question. Underneath it is
usually one of three things: *what do I actually want*, *what am I
afraid will happen if I get it*, or *whose permission am I still
waiting for*.

Whichever one it is changes everything about what happens next.
